get.description:
Convert any camera ID, including of .NET SDK to WEP version and vice versa.
      Due to the .NET SDK requiring different ID format for cameras with multiple heads or encoders,
      when the conversion direction is `FROM_WEB_ENDPOINT`, both `cameraId` and `multisensorId` will be returned.
      The `multisensorId` should be used whenever the ID of a multisensor camera is to be used;
      in all other circumstances the `cameraId` should be used. A common convention is to always use the `cameraId`,
      and if it fails, to try again with the `multisensorId`.<br/><br/>
      {
        "cameraId": "0a0e312e3030313838353061353463641a10dd2da76bc9c1447fbef2ed995d345b8d2210b12194a981484dcba23f8013fddfd66e380a",
        // optional
        "multiheadId": "0a14312e3030313838353061353463642e63616d30301a10dd2da76bc9c1447fbef2ed995d345b8d2210b12194a98148ba23f8013fddfd66e380a",
      }
